{"version":1,"key":"quest:111","content":{"id":111,"title":"npm link 的原理是什么？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:111","type":"quest","id":111},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"npm link 的原理、依赖问题与取消链接","meta":"","excerpt":"npm link 的原理就是在全局的 node_modules 和本地的包或者项目中的 node_modules 建立符号链接。 如果在一个本地的包中执行 npm link，假设这个包的名称是 my-lib，执行 npm link 后会在全局 node_modules 中创建一个  my-lib 的符号链接指向本地的包","target":{"key":"card:659","type":"card","id":659},"citeKey":"card:659"}],"trail":[{"time":1763188835816,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1767358876892,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1767358876931,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"createTime":1763188835816,"updateTime":1763188835816,"resolvedTime":1767358876931},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1763188835816}}